        "uuid": "474ed44c_c95581cb",
        "filename": "staging/security/see/hwcrypto/aidl/android/hardware/security/see/hwcrypto/IOpaqueKey.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 111,
      "author": {
        "id": 1942645
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-03T19:11:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we are just using something DH related yes (and on a DH implementation this would be that) but we are also getting ready to have some post-quantum algorithm. Using a KEM let us generalize the concept to a point on which we are not using a DH based algorithm anymore.",
      "parentUuid": "c6fd083a_2cbdcec5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 111,
        "startChar": 34,
        "endLine": 111,
        "endChar": 70
      },
      "revId": "37093bf2b94309d3d3c1837e911b5f577b028480",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
